<p class="Polityka3" style="margin-left:0cm;text-indent:0cm;line-height:10pt;;"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk31620209"><span style="font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.05pt">Spółka tworzy rezerwy na kary i
