<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:0cm;line-height:10pt;;"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Ref115007376"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Ref115007247"><i><span style="font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;">Analiza wrażliwości na zmiany
