<p class="Sprawozdaniefinansowe2"><a id="_Toc194498162"><span><span>33.<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">  
</span></span></span>Zysk / (strata) na akcję</a></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:0cm;"><b><span style="font-size:8.0pt;line-height:1.347398;;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;">Podstawowy</span></b></p>

